<p class="lead">The Mathews Prima is a compact compound bow built from the ground up for short-draw shooters, rather than a big bow cut down to fit. With a 30-inch axle-to-axle length, a draw range that tops out at 27.5 inches and a mass weight under four pounds, the Prima bow gives smaller-framed hunters a true Mathews shooting experience that actually fits them.</p>

<p>This guide covers verified Mathews Prima specs, how the Level 1 package is typically put together, what the draw cycle and handling feel like in practice, and who should consider the Prima compound bow. It is sometimes searched as &ldquo;Matthews Prima&rdquo; or simply &ldquo;Prima bow,&rdquo; but it is the same bow throughout.</p>

